<https://w3id.org/italia/controlled-vocabulary/territorial-classifications/uts_soppresse>
  rdf:type      skos:ConceptScheme , adms:Asset , dcatapit:Dataset ;
  dct:title "Controlled Vocabulary of Provinces-Uts Abolished or Transferred to a Foreign State"@en , "Vocabolario Controllato delle Province-Uts soppresse o cedute a Stato estero"@it ;
  dct:description "Vocabolario controllato delle Province-Unità territoriali di livello intermedio tra il Comune e la Regione soppresse o cedute a Stato estero. Tali unità comprendono le province, le città metropolitane, le province autonome (Trentino Alto Adige), i liberi consorzi di Comuni (Sicilia), e le unità territoriali non amministrative (Friuli Venezia Giulia)."@it , "Controlled Vocabulary of Provinces/UTS of intermediate area level between the municipality and the region abolished or transferred to a foreign state. The units include provinces, metropolitan cities, autonomous province (Trentino Alto Adige), free municipal consortiums (Sicilia), and non-administrative units (Friuli Venezia Giulia)."@en ;
  xkos:numberOfLevels "1" ;
  dct:type <http://purl.org/adms/assettype/CodeList> ;
  adms:representationTechnique <http://purl.org/adms/representationtechnique/SKOS> ;
  dct:identifier "https://w3id.org/italia/controlled-vocabulary/territorial-classifications/uts_soppresse";
